  ($m1_l28_t11_title$clone и push$m1_l28_t11_title$, $m1_l28_t11_stmt$Склонируй подготовленный bare-remote, создай файл `work/hello.txt`, сделай коммит `hello remote` и отправь ветку main в origin.$m1_l28_t11_stmt$, $m1_l28_t11_starter$$m1_l28_t11_starter$, $m1_l28_t11_solution$$m1_l28_t11_solution$, 4, 150, $m1_l28_t11_topic$Месяц 1 — Python Core, терминал, Git — Git: ветки, remote, rebase$m1_l28_t11_topic$, $m1_l28_t11_lang$python$m1_l28_t11_lang$, $m1_l28_t11_policy${"language":"python","import_source":"python_course_platform_v10_import.json","checker_type":"ide_plugin","checker":{"type":"ide_plugin","timeout_sec":90,"required_files":["work/hello.txt"],"required_dirs":["work"],"forbidden_files":[".env","secrets.json","__pycache__/",".venv/"],"commands":[{"cmd":"cd work && git log --oneline -1 --pretty=%s","expected_stdout":"hello remote\n","timeout_sec":5}],"send_to_server_for_hidden_tests":true},"hints":[],"hints_visibility":"button_or_after_failed_attempts","ai_hint_config":{"mode":"socratic","no_full_solution":true},"ai_review_config":{"enabled":true,"mode":"rubric_review","rubric":["требования выполнены","структура читаемая","тесты проходят","нет секретов","README позволяет запустить проект"],"verdicts":["pass","needs_revision","fail"],"no_code_rewrite":true},"admin_notes":"IDE plugin + AI review."}$m1_l28_t11_policy$::jsonb),
  ($m1_l28_t12_title$fetch без merge$m1_l28_t12_title$, $m1_l28_t12_stmt$В remote появился новый коммит. Выполни fetch, посмотри отличие origin/main от main, затем подтяни изменения без потери локального коммита.$m1_l28_t12_stmt$, $m1_l28_t12_starter$$m1_l28_t12_starter$, $m1_l28_t12_solution$$m1_l28_t12_solution$, 4, 150, $m1_l28_t12_topic$Месяц 1 — Python Core, терминал, Git — Git: ветки, remote, rebase$m1_l28_t12_topic$, $m1_l28_t12_lang$python$m1_l28_t12_lang$, $m1_l28_t12_policy${"language":"python","import_source":"python_course_platform_v10_import.json","checker_type":"ide_plugin","checker":{"type":"ide_plugin","timeout_sec":90,"required_files":["team.txt"],"required_dirs":[],"forbidden_files":[".env","secrets.json","__pycache__/",".venv/"],"commands":[{"cmd":"git status --short","expected_stdout":"","timeout_sec":5}],"send_to_server_for_hidden_tests":true},"hints":[],"hints_visibility":"button_or_after_failed_attempts","ai_hint_config":{"mode":"socratic","no_full_solution":true},"ai_review_config":{"enabled":true,"mode":"rubric_review","rubric":["требования выполнены","структура читаемая","тесты проходят","нет секретов","README позволяет запустить проект"],"verdicts":["pass","needs_revision","fail"],"no_code_rewrite":true},"admin_notes":"IDE plugin + AI review."}$m1_l28_t12_policy$::jsonb),
  ($m1_l28_t13_title$non-fast-forward$m1_l28_t13_title$, $m1_l28_t13_stmt$Смоделируй ошибку non-fast-forward. Нельзя использовать force-push: подтяни remote-изменения, разреши конфликт и отправь обычный push.$m1_l28_t13_stmt$, $m1_l28_t13_starter$$m1_l28_t13_starter$, $m1_l28_t13_solution$$m1_l28_t13_solution$, 4, 150, $m1_l28_t13_topic$Месяц 1 — Python Core, терминал, Git — Git: ветки, remote, rebase$m1_l28_t13_topic$, $m1_l28_t13_lang$python$m1_l28_t13_lang$, $m1_l28_t13_policy${"language":"python","import_source":"python_course_platform_v10_import.json","checker_type":"ide_plugin","checker":{"type":"ide_plugin","timeout_sec":90,"required_files":["team.txt"],"required_dirs":[],"forbidden_files":[".env","secrets.json","__pycache__/",".venv/"],"commands":[{"cmd":"git log --oneline --all --pretty=%s | grep \"remote change\"","expected_stdout_contains":"remote change","timeout_sec":5}],"send_to_server_for_hidden_tests":true},"hints":[],"hints_visibility":"button_or_after_failed_attempts","ai_hint_config":{"mode":"socratic","no_full_solution":true},"ai_review_config":{"enabled":true,"mode":"rubric_review","rubric":["требования выполнены","структура читаемая","тесты проходят","нет секретов","README позволяет запустить проект"],"verdicts":["pass","needs_revision","fail"],"no_code_rewrite":true},"admin_notes":"IDE plugin + AI review."}$m1_l28_t13_policy$::jsonb),
  ($m1_l28_t14_title$reflog rescue$m1_l28_t14_title$, $m1_l28_t14_stmt$После ошибочного reset восстанови коммит `important change` через reflog. Итоговая история снова должна содержать этот коммит.$m1_l28_t14_stmt$, $m1_l28_t14_starter$$m1_l28_t14_starter$, $m1_l28_t14_solution$$m1_l28_t14_solution$, 4, 150, $m1_l28_t14_topic$Месяц 1 — Python Core, терминал, Git — Git: ветки, remote, rebase$m1_l28_t14_topic$, $m1_l28_t14_lang$python$m1_l28_t14_lang$, $m1_l28_t14_policy${"language":"python","import_source":"python_course_platform_v10_import.json","checker_type":"ide_plugin","checker":{"type":"ide_plugin","timeout_sec":90,"required_files":["important.txt"],"required_dirs":[],"forbidden_files":[".env","secrets.json","__pycache__/",".venv/"],"commands":[{"cmd":"git log --pretty=%s | grep \"important change\"","expected_stdout_contains":"important change","timeout_sec":5}],"send_to_server_for_hidden_tests":true},"hints":[],"hints_visibility":"button_or_after_failed_attempts","ai_hint_config":{"mode":"socratic","no_full_solution":true},"ai_review_config":{"enabled":true,"mode":"rubric_review","rubric":["требования выполнены","структура читаемая","тесты проходят","нет секретов","README позволяет запустить проект"],"verdicts":["pass","needs_revision","fail"],"no_code_rewrite":true},"admin_notes":"IDE plugin + AI review."}$m1_l28_t14_policy$::jsonb),
